title: What is typed is written to disk a moment after typing stops, without Ctrl+S, and quitting asks nothing
folders: edit-odd
limit: 40
forbid-log: cannot edit
expect-log: saved .*a\.txt
expect-file: edit-odd/a.txt :: kept by itself


wait 3000
edit a.txt 3 1
type kept by itself
key enter
wait 1500
mark saved-by-itself
wait 400
quit
